<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts H&amp;M as &quot;hold&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts H&amp;M as &quot;hold&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hennes and Mauritz was rated &quot;hold&quot; as CS First Boston started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Analyst David Shriver said the stock's strong performance over the past 12 months left it looking stretched on almost every valuation criteria.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
